ch it will go  through a full and thorough legal and  national security review Adam Schiff has  already laid down a marker insisting  that any political redactions would show  nothing more than White House  stonewalling forcing him to seek another  venue through which he could release his  memo though it's unlikely such efforts  would bear fruit in time to really  matter Shannon all right John Roberts  live for us in the White House thank you  John

